    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Media Innovation Centre's Innovators-in-Residence team, AM Media, opened its doors to the world when they officially launched their startup, Debunk Media. Comprised of journalists, data scientists, filmmakers, illustrators, animators and even a medical doctor, the team seeks to combine their expertise to tell stories and make sense of the big issues affecting their audiences.",
